  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Conservation and Sustainable Management of Sharks and Rays in Libyan Waters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project conserves sharks and rays in Libya&#x2019;s Mediterranean waters by combining science, capacity building, sustainable fisheries, and community engagement. Aligned with the NBSAP and the Blue Economy Committee&#x2019;s work, it advances the Kunming&#x2013;Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework through healthier ecosystems, resilient livelihoods, and inclusive marine governance, and the implementation of key mandates on the conservation of sharks and rays under CMS.</narrative>
  </description>
